      "content": "This memo should clearly state that the company is a business entity, not a political forum, and therefore, political expression must remain outside of work hours and company property. Employees have the right to their personal beliefs, but the workplace must remain a neutral zone focused on professional goals and productivity. Any expression that disrupts the work environment or harasses colleagues must be strictly prohibited and subject to disciplinary action.",
